Z||000003||Tweek||06-18-2001||03:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroSTETZ:<BR><B>my computer typically downloads around 500-600 k/sec transfer rate, but when i go to the speed tests it shows results close to yours</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>2 Possible reasons...  <P>1. Download sites are often slow and overloaded ie. happypuppy.com whereas bandwidth testing sites usually have a good connection.<P>2. There is a difference between kb(bits) per sec. and kb(bytes) per sec. There are 8 bits in a byte.||||reg||1
